OL,3,GNEWSAArson arrest after fire ravages
OL,4,AGrade II listed pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Farson after a Grade II listed pub was
OL,8,Fseverely damaged by fire.
OL,10,FCrews from Essex County Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService were called to the The Worlds
OL,12,FEnd Pub in Tilbury, Thurrock, at 15:30
OL,13,FBST on Wednesday.
OL,15,FThe fire service said it was brought
OL,16,Funder control by 18:30 but firefighters
OL,17,Fremained at the scene on Fort Road
OL,18,Fthroughout the evening to check for hot
OL,19,Fspots and make sure the area was safe.
